// tables, fields (null when Word can't count them), contentControls,
// sections; input.labels: each label's run formatting (see Heading format).
// Returns { style (the v2 shape), headingLines (≤ 40, for the AI follow-up),
// labelCandidates (the labels to read the formatting of), overview,
// provenance }. init runs it twice: for the labels, then with them.

