// docStyleSignature(paragraphs, parties) — the signature block: where it starts (after "IN WITNESS WHEREOF" or the
// like, else the last "By:" lines), its layout (a table, tab-aligned columns, or stacked), the party-name lines, the
// labels in order, the signature lines, the slots against the preamble's parties and the blanks left to fill.

